        "role": "user",
        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"6e4ded20-9d9c-4b13-8b98-d7ababbe2d80\",\"review_text\":\"Very good\"},{\"review_id\":\"c05f8aec-cecb-450e-b299-89329c543e86\",\"review_text\":\"I am really disappointed with Spotify. It was working really good until the recent update. I am really surprised that I can't replay the songs,I can't switch off the shuffle feature neither I can sort out album. I can't even select the lyric from which we need to continue . No repeat option is visible. I am just so disappointed . I request the faculties and Spotify studios to look into this matter ASAP. I can't get the Spotify premium for these basic features. PLEASE RESTORE THESE FEATURES ASAP.\"},{\"review_id\":\"99f547ef-30e3-410e-82bc-d9b56694ef31\",\"review_text\":\"It's just kind of bad in general Spotify doesn't even work I signed in I played a song it worked but next week later it does not work I can only hear 1% of the song in the song keeps changing leave\"},{\"review_id\":\"765b9090-90c4-472b-b687-b7cc76f7fd18\",\"review_text\":\"best music app out there!\"},{\"review_id\":\"3a3ff7ae-9f20-464d-b856-abb097591128\",\"review_text\":\"Worst update ever since i downloaded the app\"},{\"review_id\":\"bcad6a7e-7c8b-4285-8f52-3b5b69729a78\",\"review_text\":\"Well, Spotify used to be one of my favourite apps, but from some days after the update I started to experience lag and couldn't able to load the lyrics without premium. I kept on deleting and reinstalling the app thinking there is some kinda issue with my phone, but after reading some of the reviews I got to know, it is because of the latest update which is such a big issue.\"},{\"review_id\":\"d89bc403-d018-42f0-a1f6-d49e2c4ec093\",\"review_text\":\"Dg gene hehe\"},{\"review_id\":\"91ad5e92-f927-4b59-bc5d-e7f0fbb49277\",\"review_text\":\"Good quality and quantity of music. Disappointed that stuff disappears for no reason.\"},{\"review_id\":\"16929558-ce1e-4b87-8738-a1de3f557f66\",\"review_text\":\"I paid my subscription and im still getting a pause subscription screen and can't access my music...... help me\"},{\"review_id\":\"f9867fe9-d0f1-4be6-9bf4-30b2bdacd8cf\",\"review_text\":\"I'm only using it to listen to the fall guys theme song\"}]}"
